{
  "name": "金蜘蛛上挑 60 线",
  "status": "structured",
  "timeframe": "1d",
  "source_pages": [486, 487, 488, 489],
  "source": "金蜘蛛上挑60线，是指5日、10日、20日、120日均线在较短时间内形成金叉密集区，构成金蜘蛛，随后股价上挑60日线；该图形常见于庄股洗盘至120线附近后重新启动。",
  "source_summary": "若短中期均线在短窗内密集形成金叉，并随后向上突破60日线，可视为金蜘蛛上挑60线。",
  "comment": "当前按多组金叉在短窗内依次出现、随后突破60线的简化版本提取。",
  "computable_from_daily_ocvhl": true,
  "required_fields": ["close"],
  "warmup_bars": 130,
  "indicator_type": "breakout_rule",
  "params": {
    "cluster_window": 8,
    "signal_keep_days": 5,
    "allow_same_day": true
  },
  "series": [
    {
      "id": "ma_5",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 5,
      "description": "5日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_10",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 10,
      "description": "10日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_20",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 20,
      "description": "20日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_60",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 60,
      "description": "60日均线"
    },
    {
      "id": "ma_120",
      "op": "sma",
      "field": "close",
      "window": 120,
      "description": "120日均线"
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "id": "cross_5_10",
      "op": "cross_up",
      "left": "ma_5",
      "right": "ma_10",
      "description": "5日线上穿10日线"
    },
    {
      "id": "cross_10_20",
      "op": "cross_up",
      "left": "ma_10",
      "right": "ma_20",
      "description": "10日线上穿20日线"
    },
    {
      "id": "cross_20_120",
      "op": "cross_up",
      "left": "ma_20",
      "right": "ma_120",
      "description": "20日线上穿120日线"
    },
    {
      "id": "cross_close_60",
      "op": "cross_up",
      "left": "close",
      "right": "ma_60",
      "description": "收盘上穿60日线"
    }
  ],
  "rules": {
    "latest_match": {
      "op": "within",
      "window": "$params.signal_keep_days",
      "condition": {
        "op": "and",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "op": "sequence",
            "events": [
              "cross_5_10",
              "cross_10_20",
              "cross_20_120",
              "cross_close_60"
            ],
            "window": "$params.cluster_window",
            "allow_same_day": "$params.allow_same_day"
          },
          {
            "op": "compare",
            "left": "close",
            "operator": ">",
            "right": "ma_120"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "calculation_steps": [
    "计算5/10/20/60/120日均线。",
    "识别5、10、20、120日均线在短窗内形成的多组金叉，近似金蜘蛛共振。",
    "要求之后收盘上穿60日线，并维持在120日线上方。"
  ],
  "signal_day_definition": "以收盘上穿60日线且前置金叉簇已完成的当日作为金蜘蛛上挑60线确认日。",
  "manual_review_needed": [
    "原文还强调前期洗盘至120线附近、前高T线和筹码峰压力，这里未全部纳入主规则。"
  ],
  "implementation_notes": [
    "warmup_bars >= max(120 + cluster_window + 1, 60 + 1)。"
  ],
  "explain": "该规则用短窗内多组金叉共振加突破60日线来近似‘金蜘蛛上挑60线’。"
}
